sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Utente C (pagina "Le mie task")
    participant WSGW as ws-gateway (pod Y)
    participant API as api-service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Redis (Pub/Sub)
    participant Q as Redis (Streams)
    participant W as worker

    C->>WSGW: WSS connect (JWT)
    C->>WSGW: subscribe(my_tasks)
    WSGW->>WSGW: risolve organizzazioni dell'utente
    WSGW->>R: SUBSCRIBE evt:org:{org_id}:tasks
    WSGW->>R: SUBSCRIBE evt:user:{user_id}:notifications

    Note over API,PG: un altro utente assegna la task 123 a C e lo menziona in un commento
    API->>PG: UPDATE tasks / INSERT comment_mentions
    API->>R: PUBLISH evt:org:{org_id}:tasks {task.updated, task_id:123}
    API->>Q: XADD stream:jobs {type: notification, notification_type: mention, recipient_ids:[C]}

    R-->>WSGW: evento su evt:org:{org_id}:tasks
    WSGW->>WSGW: verifica permesso di C sulla task 123 (cache)
    WSGW-->>C: push {task 123 updated} (lista si aggiorna)

    Q-->>W: XREADGROUP consuma il job notification
    W->>PG: INSERT INTO notifications (user_id=C, type=mention, ...)
    W->>R: PUBLISH evt:user:{C}:notifications {notification.created}
    R-->>WSGW: evento su evt:user:{C}:notifications
    WSGW-->>C: push {nuova notifica} (badge si aggiorna)
